  this.context.memoryLimit.use(str.length)
  return str.replace(/<script[\s\S]*?<\/script>|<style[\s\S]*?<\/style>|<.*?>|<!--[\s\S]*?-->/g, '')
}
```

The regex contains four lazy patterns:
1. `<script[\s\S]*?<\/script>`
2. `<style[\s\S]*?<\/style>`
3. `<.*?>`
4. `<!--[\s\S]*?-->`

